      "bullets": [
        "Dual-language bootstrapping demonstrates implementing a stack-based Forth virtual machine inside Lisp to study minimalist interpreter construction and meta-compilation.",
        "Reciprocally compiling S-expression evaluation in Forth showcases cross-paradigm execution, bridging stack manipulation with dynamic tree-structured data evaluation.",
